WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:11.340
It is important for the College not just to
express gratitude, but to be actually and

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:14.340
genuinely grateful for the support.

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:20.250
There are so many ways, big and small, that
we can show gratitude--even things as small

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:22.470
as the Day of Thanks.

00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:28.490
These are the people who allow us to gladly
learn and gladly teach.

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:30.509
That is a huge blessing.

00:00:30.509 --> 00:00:32.449
Of course gratitude is appropriate.

